695
00:31:50,617 --> 00:31:52,160
[Shime] Whoa, here they come!

696
00:31:52,244 --> 00:31:55,664
-[Machu laughs] Amazing. [exclaims]
-[Genta] Look. It's starting already!

697
00:32:06,633 --> 00:32:08,301
[Shime exclaims]

698
00:32:08,885 --> 00:32:09,886
We got VIP seating.

699
00:32:09,970 --> 00:32:10,971
-This is nuts.
-Right?

700
00:32:19,187 --> 00:32:22,524
[in English] When you see
the cowgirl coming out of the box,

701
00:32:22,607 --> 00:32:26,236
-if they take one, two, three swings…
-Uh-huh.

702
00:32:26,319 --> 00:32:27,404
…you gotta a chance.

703
00:32:27,487 --> 00:32:29,156
-I see, I see.
-One, two, three.

704
00:32:29,239 --> 00:32:31,867
-The longer you swing down there…
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

705
00:32:32,742 --> 00:32:34,828
-The best chance is if you have three.
-Three?

706
00:32:34,911 --> 00:32:36,413
One, two, three, and then…

707
00:32:36,496 --> 00:32:37,914
Mm-hmm.

708
00:32:37,998 --> 00:32:39,332
Difficult.

709
00:32:39,416 --> 00:32:40,959
-Whoa.
-[in Japanese] Here they come.

710
00:32:43,378 --> 00:32:44,838
How cute. There's a little one too.

711
00:32:44,921 --> 00:32:47,048
-[Genta] Holy moly! There she goes!
-[Shime] Yeah!

712
00:32:48,842 --> 00:32:51,052
-Whoa.
-Whoa.

713
00:32:51,928 --> 00:32:53,930
-[Shime] Get 'em!
-[Genta] Oh, yeah.

714
00:32:56,641 --> 00:32:59,186
[members exclaiming]

715
00:32:59,269 --> 00:33:00,770
[Genta] How cool is that?

716
00:33:00,854 --> 00:33:02,147
[Machu] Such speed!

717
00:33:02,230 --> 00:33:04,065
-Whoo!
-[applause]

718
00:33:06,943 --> 00:33:08,904
-Isn't this a great show?
-How impressive!

719
00:33:08,987 --> 00:33:10,530
How do they nail the lasso every time?

720
00:33:10,614 --> 00:33:11,615
No kidding.

721
00:33:12,365 --> 00:33:13,658
-They're so skilled.
-What a show.

722
00:33:13,742 --> 00:33:15,327
It was hard enough
with an immobile target.

723
00:33:15,410 --> 00:33:16,453
It was a challenge.

724
00:33:33,386 --> 00:33:35,096
-What an energized venue.
-The crowd went wild.

725
00:33:35,180 --> 00:33:37,349
What a thrill.
It was such an exciting show.

726
00:33:37,432 --> 00:33:38,433
What an experience.

727
00:33:38,516 --> 00:33:40,018
Can you believe we rode horses? Actually?

728
00:33:40,101 --> 00:33:42,187
-Man, I had the time of my life.
-Mmm.

729
00:33:42,270 --> 00:33:43,939
Even better, we got to do it side by side.

730
00:33:44,022 --> 00:33:45,857
-I know, right?
-I thought we were taking turns,

731
00:33:45,941 --> 00:33:47,609
but we
all got to ride our horses simultaneously.

732
00:33:47,692 --> 00:33:49,027
I know.

733
00:33:49,110 --> 00:33:51,238
-Today was the best day ever.
-It felt so wonderful.

734
00:33:51,321 --> 00:33:56,785
I heard that an even bigger
competition will be held soon.

735
00:33:56,868 --> 00:33:57,869
Right.

736
00:33:57,953 --> 00:33:59,829
There are many rodeo competitions,

737
00:33:59,913 --> 00:34:03,250
and apparently,
the prize pool is pretty decent.

738
00:34:03,333 --> 00:34:05,001
-That tracks.
-[Genta] I want to come again.

739
00:34:05,085 --> 00:34:06,628
-We'll come here again.
-That's right.

740
00:34:07,420 --> 00:34:09,005
-That was a blissful moment.
-Right?

741
00:34:09,089 --> 00:34:11,925
Let's go say
goodbye to the cows before we leave.

742
00:34:12,008 --> 00:34:13,426
-We'll say hi to the cows…
-No objection.

743
00:34:13,510 --> 00:34:16,012
-…then we'll head out.
-[Genta] Let's go see the cows.

744
00:34:18,223 --> 00:34:20,058
-Bye.
-[Genta] Good luck, you guys.

745
00:34:20,809 --> 00:34:22,102
-See you again.
-Laters!

746
00:34:22,602 --> 00:34:23,603
We'll be back.

747
00:34:24,813 --> 00:34:26,856
-Bye bye.
-[in English] Love you guys.

748
00:34:26,940 --> 00:34:28,275
-[in Japanese] Bye now.
-See you!

749
00:34:29,276 --> 00:34:31,069
I'm hungry now.
Wanna go grab a bite somewhere?

750
00:34:31,152 --> 00:34:32,487
-Good idea.
-Let's go find dinner.

751
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:35,949
-Or we'll go straight to bed.
-Wanna hit the hay?

752
00:34:36,032 --> 00:34:37,200
We were on our feet all day.

753
00:34:37,284 --> 00:34:38,576
-That's true.
-No joke.

754
00:34:42,497 --> 00:34:45,250
[in Japanese]
Team B's trip also comes to a close.

755
00:34:45,333 --> 00:34:48,670
Now, everyone's
en route to Sedona where Noel awaits.

756
00:34:57,304 --> 00:34:59,806
Before they rejoin
the rest of the members,

757
00:34:59,889 --> 00:35:02,100
Team B throw
one last hurrah for their ride.

758
00:35:17,699 --> 00:35:19,284
-[Shime] Thank you.
-[Machu] No worries.

759
00:35:20,076 --> 00:35:21,286
Thanks, bro.

760
00:35:23,496 --> 00:35:25,665
-All righty! Let's get you cleaned up.
-[Machu] Hup.

761
00:35:25,749 --> 00:35:27,375
-We'll make you spotless.
-Let's make it clean.

762
00:35:28,001 --> 00:35:29,002
Ten minutes okay?

763
00:35:31,087 --> 00:35:32,380
[Genta] Cool.

764
00:35:33,798 --> 00:35:34,924
[Machu] Awesome!

765
00:35:35,550 --> 00:35:37,719
It's my first time operating
a car wash. How does it work?

766
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:39,220
-I think you rinse the car with this.
-Oh!

767
00:35:39,304 --> 00:35:41,765
Good going. Nice!

768
00:35:41,848 --> 00:35:44,142
-Nicely done.
-[cheers]

769
00:35:44,225 --> 00:35:46,394
[Machu] Thanks for taking us everywhere.

770
00:35:46,478 --> 00:35:48,438
-Thanks, partner.
-Seriously, you were the best.

771
00:35:48,521 --> 00:35:49,564
Scrub away!

772
00:35:51,316 --> 00:35:52,651
This is cool.

773
00:35:52,734 --> 00:35:53,735
Ready for more?

774
00:35:54,486 --> 00:35:55,654
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

775
00:35:55,737 --> 00:35:57,197
-[laughing]
-Wait, wait, wait…

776
00:35:59,407 --> 00:36:00,950
-Are you okay?
-I'm good, I'm good.

777
00:36:01,701 --> 00:36:02,744
[shouts]

778
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:04,120
-You good?
-Shoot.

779
00:36:06,081 --> 00:36:07,332
I'm covered in foam.

780
00:36:08,375 --> 00:36:10,293
-Thanks, partner.
-[Machu] You're the best.

781
00:36:10,377 --> 00:36:12,545
[Shime] Shall we give it a rinse?

782
00:36:12,629 --> 00:36:14,881
Hold on.
Shime, can you bring the hose this way?

783
00:36:14,964 --> 00:36:16,007
Okay, leave it to me.

784
00:36:16,091 --> 00:36:19,344
-[Genta] Yes! Thanks, partner.
-[Shime] Hold on. The other way?

785
00:36:19,427 --> 00:36:20,762
[Machu] Nice.

786
00:36:23,139 --> 00:36:24,224
[Shime] Yes!

787
00:36:24,307 --> 00:36:26,101
Let's move on to the bottom half, yeah?

788
00:36:26,184 --> 00:36:27,394
[Shime] Let's go!

789
00:36:27,977 --> 00:36:29,938
-This is kinda fun.
-[Machu, Genta] This is a blast!

790
00:36:33,108 --> 00:36:35,610
-Hey, Shime, come here, and…
-Got it. Okay, thanks.

791
00:36:36,319 --> 00:36:38,154
-[laughing]
-Careful, careful, careful!

792
00:36:38,238 --> 00:36:42,534
Why'd you do that?
Hey, I told you! You'll get me soaked!

793
00:36:45,954 --> 00:36:47,288
[machine whirring]

794
00:36:47,372 --> 00:36:48,373
Well?

795
00:36:48,456 --> 00:36:50,166
-Over there, over there.
-This way.

796
00:36:51,042 --> 00:36:52,836
-[Machu] Go, go!
-[Genta] Get it!

797
00:36:53,586 --> 00:36:55,213
[Machu] Time to dry the car.

798
00:36:55,296 --> 00:36:58,216
-Whoa! We're gonna run out of time!
-[Genta] That's enough.

799
00:37:15,483 --> 00:37:17,694
-Is it all done?
-[Genta, Machu] All done.

800
00:37:17,777 --> 00:37:19,362
-It'll dry like this.
-Nice!

801
00:37:19,446 --> 00:37:20,739
-It'll dry on its own.
-Nice!

802
00:37:20,822 --> 00:37:22,615
-Thank you, thank you.
-Nice, nice, nice.

803
00:37:22,699 --> 00:37:24,409
-Nice!
-Nice!

804
00:37:24,492 --> 00:37:25,535
Man, that was a blast.

805
00:37:25,618 --> 00:37:26,619
-It was so exciting.
-Right?

806
00:37:26,703 --> 00:37:29,497
-Looks much better, doesn't it?
-Look how shiny it is now!

807
00:37:29,581 --> 00:37:32,208
-The trip went by in a blink of an eye.
-Yep.

808
00:37:32,292 --> 00:37:34,043
-I agree.
-True that.

809
00:37:35,086 --> 00:37:38,006
[Machu] This week was packed
with unforgettable experiences.

810
00:37:38,089 --> 00:37:40,383
-I completely agree.
-It was such an incredible week.

811
00:37:41,676 --> 00:37:43,887
You'd never get to do this otherwise.

812
00:37:44,846 --> 00:37:47,474
What moments stuck out to you?

813
00:37:47,557 --> 00:37:50,727
Huh? I've gotta say, horseback riding.

814
00:37:50,810 --> 00:37:51,853
[Machu] The horse, huh?

815
00:37:51,936 --> 00:37:54,481
-You mean, yesterday.
-The horse… I love horses,

816
00:37:54,564 --> 00:37:58,818
and I got to learn
about the Native American culture.

817
00:37:59,486 --> 00:38:03,406
I was happy I got to connect
with the Native culture and people.

818
00:38:03,490 --> 00:38:04,824
I love that for you.

819
00:38:04,908 --> 00:38:07,035
-It really was the best.
-My highlight was the train.

820
00:38:07,118 --> 00:38:08,787
The steam locomotive.
We liked the town too.

821
00:38:08,870 --> 00:38:10,121
We did.

822
00:38:10,205 --> 00:38:12,874
-[Machu] My favorite was the hot springs.
-[Genta] The hot springs.

823
00:38:12,957 --> 00:38:15,794
It was sublime. I'm
a big fan of hot springs, as you all know.

824
00:38:15,877 --> 00:38:17,545
-Right.
-And now, I can say

825
00:38:17,629 --> 00:38:20,131
-I've been to the hot springs in the US.
-True.

826
00:38:20,215 --> 00:38:22,217
Never did I think it was
in the cards for me.

827
00:38:22,300 --> 00:38:24,093
It was an item checked off my bucket list.

828
00:38:24,177 --> 00:38:25,470
-I can see that.
-[Genta] Yeah.

829
00:38:25,553 --> 00:38:32,268
I wonder what Noel was trying
to tell us by pairing us up? Like what…

830
00:38:33,812 --> 00:38:34,813
How do I put it?

831
00:38:35,772 --> 00:38:38,149
What did he want us
to take away from this trip?

832
00:38:38,233 --> 00:38:40,485
-Certainly, this was a trip of learning.
-I agree.

833
00:38:40,568 --> 00:38:44,781
[Genta] We became
more aware of the American history

834
00:38:44,864 --> 00:38:46,491
and the Native American story.

835
00:38:46,574 --> 00:38:47,951
[Machu] I agree.

836
00:38:48,034 --> 00:38:51,329
[Shime] This trip made us fall
even deeper in love with our passions.

837
00:38:51,412 --> 00:38:54,249
-Definitely.
-[Genta] You're onto something. It's true.

838
00:38:54,874 --> 00:38:58,044
We had countless encounters and growth.

839
00:38:58,127 --> 00:39:00,839
[Genta] That's right.
We had many wonderful encounters.

840
00:39:00,922 --> 00:39:02,715
[Shime] Everyone we met was wonderful.

841
00:39:02,799 --> 00:39:05,593
-[Machu] They really were.
-Everyone we met was kindhearted.

842
00:39:07,262 --> 00:39:09,138
-Nice, nice, nice!
-Good as new.

843
00:39:10,223 --> 00:39:12,392
-Thanks, partner.
-Thanks!

844
00:39:13,601 --> 00:39:15,061
Thank you, from the bottom of our hearts.

845
00:39:21,150 --> 00:39:23,194
[Noel] Preparations are all set.

846
00:39:25,947 --> 00:39:28,283
I can't wait to see everyone.

847
00:40:48,237 --> 00:40:50,239
Translated by Megumi Hunter
